            "4"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Which is More? ⚖️",
      "text": "On the number line, numbers further along are greater! 14 is more than 9 because 14 comes after 9. The plate with 14 apples has more than the plate with 9 apples!",
      "emoji": "⚖️",
      "bgColor": "from-blue-400 to-indigo-500",
      "spoken": "",
      "diagram": {
        "type": "bar-chart",
