    },
    {
      "title": "Read the Whole Numeral! 🧠",
      "text": "Never judge a number by a single digit! 11 is more than 9 because eleven is a two-digit teen number that comes after nine on the number line. Always read the whole numeral!",
      "emoji": "💡",
